    date "2022-06-02T07:30:03Z"
    title "How Monkeypox virus KILLS? (3D Animation) #shorts"
    description "#shorts &#10;&#10;Want to learn 3D Animation? For 3D Course Queries, WhatsApp us at: +91-9983083303 or visit professorofhow.com &#10;&#10;How Monkeypox virus KILLS? (3D Animation) #shorts &#10;This is a person infected with Monkeypox virus. There is a deep fear in people regarding if this Monkeypox virus also came out to be a pandemic as the Coronavirus was. So let's take the help of Medical 3D Animation to understand whether this Monkeypox virus is really fatal or not. &#10;&#10;Monkeypox is a viral zoonotic disease, i.e., this disease spreads out from animals and then homes the human population. This is a Monkeypox virus. Monkeypox virus is present on the body of rodents like rat, squirrel etc. If a person has any wound on his body, and then if he comes in contact with an already infected animal, the Monkeypox virus will enter that person's body through that wound. Besides that, Monkeypox virus also spreads out through respiration.&#10;&#10;This virus causes severe headache, fever, body pain, and rashes on your skin after 2-5 days of entering in your body. These rashes grow into this type of fluid-filled blisters after few days. This appearance of blisters starts from the face and then slowly spreads to other body parts. After few days, these blisters take the form of pustules, where the liquid of these blisters get converted into a kind of pus, which can be an extremely painful experience for you. To watch more interesting 3D videos, kindly hit that red subscribe button.&#10;#monkeypox #monkeypoxvirus #virus #animatedshorts &#10;&#10;Rat - https://sketchfab.com/Nyilonelycompany&#10;Monkey - https://sketchfab.com/TdoubleU8&#10;World_Map - https://sketchfab.com/limyankaidarryl&#10;Thermometer: https://sketchfab.com/blackcube4&#10;Squirrel: https://sketchfab.com/hideyoshi_0715"
