    title "Monkeypox Explained Clearly"
    description "Roger Seheult, MD of MedCram explains what monkeypox is and the current treatments. See all Dr. Seheult's videos at: https://www.medcram.com&#10;(This video was recorded on May 23, 2022)&#10;&#10;Roger Seheult, MD is the co-founder and lead professor at https://www.medcram.com&#10;He is Board Certified in Internal Medicine, Pulmonary Disease, Critical Care, and Sleep Medicine and an Associate Professor at the University of California, Riverside School of Medicine.&#10;&#10;&#10;LINKS / REFERENCES:&#10;&#10;Monkeypox: Doctors warn of &#8216;massive impact&#8217; on sexual health services as staff self-isolate (Yahoo) | https://uk.news.yahoo.com/monkeypox-doctors-warn-massive-impact-151000110.html&#10;&#10;Monkeypox outbreak linked to superspreader event at adult sauna (Yahoo) | https://news.yahoo.com/monkeypox-outbreak-doubles-health-authorities-064252837.html&#10;&#10;MISCExplainer: What to Know About Monkeypox (Visual Capitalist) | https://www.visualcapitalist.com/explainer-what-to-know-about-monkeypox/&#10;&#10;Human monkeypox: an emerging zoonosis (Lancet) | https://www.thelancet.com/journals/laninf/article/PIIS1473-3099(03)00856-9/fulltext&#10;&#10;First monkeypox genome from latest outbreak shows links to 2018 strain&#10;(NewScientist) | https://www.newscientist.com/article/2321407-first-monkeypox-genome-from-latest-outbreak-shows-links-to-2018-strain/&#10;&#10;Monkeypox virus evades antiviral CD4+ and CD8+ T cell responses by suppressing cognate T cell activation (PNAS) | https://www.pnas.org/doi/10.1073/pnas.0800589105&#10;&#10;FDA approves first live, non-replicating vaccine to prevent smallpox and monkeypox (FDA) | https://www.fda.gov/news-events/press-announcements/fda-approves-first-live-non-replicating-vaccine-prevent-smallpox-and-monkeypox&#10;&#10;Nov 3, 2021 ACIP Meeting - Orthopoxviruses Vaccines (CDC) | https://youtu.be/4SCUOppgtxE&#10;&#10;Israel reports first case of monkeypox, suspects others (ABC) | https://abcnews.go.com/Health/wireStory/israel-reports-case-monkeypox-suspects-84889711&#10;&#10;New York officials investigate case of suspected monkeypox (Miami Herald) | https://www.miamiherald.com/latest-news/article261667207.html&#10;&#10;Visit MedCram.com for more updates on pox virus infectious disease details including monkeypox uk, monkeypox virus diagnosis, and more. &#10;&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE TO THE MEDCRAM YOUTUBE CHANNEL:&#10;&#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/MEDCRAMvideos?sub_confirmation=1&#10;Get notified of new videos by hitting the bell icon&#10;&#10;MEDCRAM WORKS WITH MEDICAL PROGRAMS AND HOSPITALS:&#10;&#10;MedCram offers group discounts for students and medical programs, hospitals, and other institutions. Contact us at customers@medcram.com if you are interested.&#10;&#10;&#10;MEDIA CONTACT: &#10;&#10;Media Contact: customers@medcram.com&#10;Media contact info: https://www.medcram.com/pages/media-contact&#10;&#10;Video Produced by Kyle Allred&#10;&#10;&#10;FOLLOW US ON SOCIAL MEDIA:&#10;&#10;https://www.facebook.com/MedCram&#10;https://twitter.com/MedCramVideos&#10;https://www.instagram.com/medcram&#10;&#10;&#10;DISCLAIMER:&#10;&#10;MedCram medical videos are for medical education and exam preparation, and NOT intended to replace recommendations from your doctor.&#10;&#10;#COVID19 #Omicron #Coronavirus"
