  [
    id 37
    label "nA8CxaJWnf8"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-23T10:23:49Z"
    title "Monkeypox virus: What to know about symptoms, how its treated"
    description "European and American health authorities have identified a number of monkeypox cases in recent days, mostly in young men. It's a surprising outbreak of disease that rarely appears outside Africa.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Health officials around the world are keeping watch for more cases because, for the first time, the disease appears to be spreading among people who didn&#8217;t travel to Africa. They stress, however, that the risk to the general population is low.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;READ MORE: https://www.wcnc.com/article/news/nation-world/what-is-monkeypox/507-4ebdb4e3-362c-4a56-abac-085ff8aaa2b2"
    channeltitle "WCNC"
    channelid "UC-RxXi2Xws6Uk22vp-sLbGA"
    favcount 0
    viewcount 8876
    likecount 75
    commentcount 95
    duration "PT2M7S"
    indegree 19
