    description "France, Germany, Belgium and Australia, are among the latest countries to detect cases of Monkeypox.&#13;&#10;They join others like Britain, where known infections doubled from nine to 20 on Friday.&#13;&#10;The virus, rarely seen outside West and Central Africa, has never spread so quickly before.&#13;&#10;Al Jazeera's @Leah Harding reports.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;- Subscribe to our channel: http://aje.io/AJSubscribe &#13;&#10;- Follow us on Twitter: https://twitter.com/AJEnglish &#13;&#10;- Find us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/aljazeera &#13;&#10;- Check our website: https://www.aljazeera.com/&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;#AlJazeeraEnglish #Monkeypox"
