    description "#Monkeypox is a rare disease. Although the cases are not that spread widely, we need to beware of this infectious virus.&#10;&#10;&#128205;It&#8217;s caused by a smallpox-like virus&#10;&#128205;It causes pustules all over the body&#10;&#128205;Monkeypox diagnosis requires PCR tests&#10;&#128205;It can spread between people through close contact&#10;&#128205;There&#8217;s currently no cure, but we have a very old vaccine that was used to eradicate smallpox&#10;&#10;For more information on different health topics, visit www.projectglobalcure.org/medical-awareness&#10;.&#10;.&#10;.&#10;.&#10;.&#10;#Monkeypoxvirus #healthawareness #staysafe #stayprotected #stayhealthy #knowthefacts #virus #infectious #coronavirus #smallpox #india #who #worldhealthorganisation #vaccine #smallpoxvaccine #health #news #indianews #indiannews #disease #spread #symptoms #avoidthespread #beware #respiratory #tecovirimat #ProjectGlobalCure #PGC #PGCCaresAboutYourHealth"
