    title "Monkeypox Virus Kaise Hota Hai | Monkeypox Kya Hai in Urdu  Hindi"
    description "What is Monkeypox? Close contact with lesions, body fluids, respiratory droplets, and infected surfaces such as bedding can spread the monkeypox virus from one person to another. Monkeypox outbreaks in Europe have created an alarming situation in many countries of Europe. Health officials are investigating it however, Monkeypox disease takes 6 to 13 days to incubate, although it can take anywhere from 5 to 21 days. According to the CDC, Monkeypox symptoms are less severe than smallpox symptoms. The illness begins with headaches, fever, and aches, then progresses to a rash on the face that spreads throughout the body if anyone infected by Monkey Pox."
