    description "Monkeypox Virus Causes &#38; Prevention- Monkeypox Kya Hai Aur Kaise Phelta He - Monkeypox Outbreak 2022&#10;&#10;Monkeypox is a rare disease similar like smallpox and its caused by monkeypox virus found mostly in Africe. &#10;&#10;Monkeypox causes flu-like symptoms such as fever and chills, and a rash develops within a few days. There&#8217;s no proven treatment for monkeypox, but it usually goes away on its own.&#10;&#10;You can prevent monkeypox virus by:&#10;&#10;Avoiding contact with infected animals.&#10;Avoiding physical contact with affected person.&#10;Washing your hands with soap and water after meeting anyone or touching animals.&#10;Thoroughly cooking all foods that contain animal meat or parts.&#10;&#10;&#10;Monkeypox outbreak has begum worldwide, but thankfully it has not detected in Pakistan yet. We still need to be very cautious about it so we can prevent ourselves from this contagious virus."
