    id 216
    label "RoOOCeE1JCo"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-06T10:16:29Z"
    title "What is Monkeypox Virus?"
    description "According to Reuters, on the 20th May local time, with more than 100 confirmed and suspected cases of monkeypox in Europe, World Health Organization confirmed that an emergency meeting on monkeypox would be held on the same day. At present, it has involved many countries including the United Kingdom, the United States, Spain, etc. A total of 80 monkeypox cases and 50 suspected cases have been repoted world wide.&#10;&#10;Monkeypox Virus Feature:&#10;1. Monkeypox is a viral zoonotic disease caused by monkeypox virus. It occurs primarily in tropical rainforest areas of Central and West Africa and is occasionally exported to other regions.&#10;2. Both monkeypox virus and smallpox virus are orthopoxviruses.&#10;3. Symptoms : Fever, Rash, Exhaustion, Swollen lymph nodes.&#10;4. Route of infection: Contact with blood, body fluids, skin, etc.&#10;5. Incubation period: usually from 6 to 13 days but can range from 5 to 21 days.&#10;&#10;Monkeypox Virus Nucleic Acid Detection Kit (Fluorescence PCR)&#10;This kit is used for in vitro qualitative detection of monkeypox virus nucleic acid in human rash fluid, nasopharyngeal swabs, throat swabs and serum samples.&#10;&#10;www.jcivd.com"
    channeltitle "JC BIOTECH"
    channelid "UCS3D6OF3JimQCOy-32dQI6A"
