    date "2022-07-06T18:59:48Z"
    title "Monkeypox virus: mokeypox causes, symptoms, and treatment options | Healtheest"
    description "Monkeypox virus:  mokeypox causes, symptoms, and treatment options&#10;&#10;Monkeypox is a rare disease caused by infection with the monkeypox virus. Monkeypox virus belongs to the Orthopoxvirus genus in the family Poxviridae. The Orthopoxvirus genus also includes variola virus (which causes smallpox), vaccinia virus (used in the smallpox vaccine), and cowpox virus. Monkeypox is not related to chickenpox.&#10;&#10;Monkeypox was first discovered in 1958 when two outbreaks of a pox-like disease occurred in colonies of monkeys kept for research. Despite being named &#8220;monkeypox&#8221;, the source of the disease remains unknown. However, African rodents and non-human primates (like monkeys) may harbor the virus and infect people.&#10;&#10;The first human case of monkeypox was recorded in 1970. Since then, monkeypox has been reported in people in several other central and western African countries. Prior to the 2022 outbreak, nearly all monkeypox outbreak cases in people outside of Africa were linked to international travel to countries where the disease commonly occurs, or through imported animals.&#10;&#10;Monkeypox symptoms:&#10;Monkeypox symptoms are similar to smallpox symptoms, but milder; and monkeypox is rarely fatal. Monkeypox is not related to chickenpox.&#10;&#10;Monkeypox symptoms can include:&#10;&#10;Fever&#10;Headache&#10;Muscle aches and backache&#10;Swollen lymph nodes&#10;Chills&#10;Exhaustion&#10;&#10;Monkeypox Treatment:&#10;There's no specific treatment for monkeypox. Your doctor will likely help keep you comfortable and try to ward off serious complications with rest, plenty of fluids, and over-the-counter meds.&#10;#MonkeypoxVisrus #MonkeypoxOutbreak #MonkeypoxSymptoms&#10;Also Visit Us On:&#10;Website - https://healtheest.com&#10;Facebook - https://web.facebook.com/Healtheest/&#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/healtheest/&#10;Pinterest - https://www.pinterest.com/healtheest/&#10;&#10;Music:&#10;Mountain Sun by Audionautix is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 license. https://creativecommons.org/licenses/...&#10;&#10;Artist: http://audionautix.com/"
    channeltitle "Healtheest"
