    title "what is monkeypox virus ? cause of monkey virus || difference B/w chickenpox and monkeypox virus ?"
    description "Dr Abdul Qadeer&#10;#drabdulqadeer &#10;#MONKEYPOX&#10;#monkeypox&#10;#monkeypoxvirus&#10;&#10;Monkeypox virus is a double-stranded DNA virus that causes monkeypox in humans and other animals. It belongs to the genus Orthopoxvirus in the family Poxviridae. It is one of the human orthopoxviruses that includes variola, cowpox, and vaccinia viruses&#10;&#10;Transmission&#10;The virus can spread both from animal to human and from human to human. Infection from animal to human can occur via an animal bite or by direct contact with an infected animal&#8217;s bodily fluids. The virus can spread from human to human by both droplet respiration and contact with fomites (touchable surfaces) from an infected person's bodily fluids. The incubation period is between 10 and 14 days. Prodromal symptoms include &#10;&#10;sign and symptoms&#10;&#10;swelling of lymph nodes&#10;muscle pain&#10;headache&#10;fever&#10;,prior to the emergence of the rash.&#10;&#10;Q&#38;A&#10;monkeypox pictures&#10;monkeypox treatment&#10;monkeypox death rate&#10;what are the symptoms of monkeypox&#10;how is  transmitted&#10;monkeypox vs chickenpox&#10;monkeypox vs smallpox&#10;monkeypox virus in pakistan&#10;monkeypox symptoms interesting facts about monkeypox"
