    id 267
    label "5l-qnRxnXEI"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-22T13:48:34Z"
    title "Facts symptoms of monkeypox virus | Amazing Facts| Interesting Facts #Short #Shorts #ytshort #Facts"
    description "Shorts Fact Entertainment&#10;Facts Symptoms Of Monkeypox Virus&#10;Signs and Symptoms&#10;In humans, the symptoms of monkeypox are similar to but milder than the symptoms of smallpox. Monkeypox begins with fever, headache, muscle aches, and exhaustion. The main difference between symptoms of smallpox and monkeypox is that monkeypox causes lymph nodes to swell (lymphadenopathy) while smallpox does not. The incubation period (time from infection to symptoms) for monkeypox is usually 7&#8722;14 days but can range from 5&#8722;21 days.&#10;The illness begins with:&#10;Fever&#10;Headache&#10;Muscle aches&#10;Backache&#10;Swollen lymph nodes&#10;Chills&#10;Exhaustion&#10;Within 1 to 3 days (sometimes longer) after the appearance of fever, the patient develops a rash, often beginning on the face then spreading to other parts of the body.&#10;Lesions progress through the following stages before falling off:&#10;Macules&#10;Papules&#10;Vesicles&#10;Pustules&#10;Scabs&#10;The illness typically lasts for 2&#8722;4 weeks. In Africa, monkeypox has been shown to cause death in as many as 1 in 10 persons who contract the disease.&#10;&#10;99 % people fail to answer &#10;Facts Anand &#10;Facts New &#10;Facts in hindi &#10;Facts Shorts &#10;Amazing Facts &#10;Interesting Facts &#10;Random Facts &#10;Top 10 Facts&#10;Fact Entertainment&#10;&#10;SUBSCRIBE NOW &#128073; https://bit.ly/37eGnkj    (&#128276;)(&#128276;)(&#128276;)&#10;&#10;&#128077; Thank you for watching , I hope you will have a good time here.&#10;&#10;Thank you for visiting our channel!&#10;&#10;Check Out These Top Trending Playlists;&#10;1-https://bit.ly/3E8mR5d&#10;2-https://bit.ly/37haRlL&#10;&#128075; CONNECT WITH ME ON SOCIAL MEDIA &#128075;&#10;FACEBOOK - https://www.facebook.com/Shorts-Fact-Entertainment-105914135431066&#10;TWITTER - &#10;INSTAGRAM -&#10;#ShortsFactEntertainment"
