    id 319
    label "Yw1WtSmpXzc"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-10T14:02:53Z"
    title "Chances of Monkeypox Virus Outbreak in Pakistan 2022 | Monkeypox Infection Vaccine  Mortality Rate"
    description "What is the Monkeypox virus pandemic, and what are monkeypox symptoms? When did the first monkeypox outbreak happen? What are the key symptoms of monkeypox infection? How is monkeypox diagnosed? Is there a cure for monkeypox? Do we have the vaccine for the monkeypox virus? What is the outbreak of the Monkeypox virus in Pakistan? Is the Monkeypox virus going to be the next pandemic after covid 19? What are monkeypox treatments and precautions? How many monkeypox cases were detected in Pakistan? What are monkeypox virus origin and mode of human transmission? How much is the monkeypox mortality rate? Is there a monkeypox cure? What do monkeypox rashes look like? How is monkeypox transmitted? Is monkeypox related to smallpox? Does the monkeypox virus spread from human to animal?&#10;&#10;Monkeypox virus is a subtype of smallpox virus first detected in 1958, and the first human case of monkeypox was recorded in 1970. The monkeypox virus is transmitted through close personal contact. It is a double-stranded DNA virus spread by skin-to-skin contact, contact with clothing or linens that have been in contact with fluid from sores, and respiratory droplets at close range. This virus transmits from animals to humans and then contaminates from human to human after contact. The Monkeypox symptoms start with flu-like symptoms, including fever, chills, headaches, and achy muscles. The severe type of rashes often begins on the face and then spreads to other body parts. This virus is diagnosed based on clinical symptoms and tests and then treated with the help of different antibiotics and poxvirus vaccines.  &#10;&#10;Please watch the video to learn more about the Monkeypox virus outbreak in Pakistan and the cure for monkeypox. Subscribe to Health Reflexion YouTube Channel and follow us on Instagram and Facebook. Thank you very much.&#10;&#8220;Health Reflexion &#8220;&#10;https://www.instagram.com/healthreflexion/&#10;&#128237; Email: healthreflection2022@gmail.com&#10;&#127760; Website: www.healthreflexion.com&#10;&#10;&#10;#MonkeypoxVirusOutbreakInPakistan2022 #MonkeypoxInfectionVaccine #MonkeypoxMortalityRate #SymptomsOfMonkeypoxVirusPandemic #MonkeyPoxVsSmallpoxDisease #MonkeypoxTreatmentAndSurvivalRate #MonkeypoxVirusPandemic #MonkeypoxSymptoms #FirstMonkeypoxOutbreak #SymptomsOfMonkeypoxInfection #MonkeypoxDiagnosis #CureForMonkeypox #MonkeypoxPrecautions #MonkeypoxCasesInPakistan #MonkeypoxOrigin #MonkeypoxCure #MonkeypoxRashes #MonkeypoxTransmission #MonkeypoxVsSmallpox #MonkeypoxPrevention #DrRabeea #DrAliAsadNaeem #HealthReflexionYouTube #MonkeypoxFatalDisease #ClinicalSymptomsDiagnosis #PoxVirusVaccines"
