    description "#shorts # youtube shorts,# treanding shorts # health care#monkey fox &#10;Monkeypox was discovered in 1958 after two outbreaks of a pox-like disease in research groups of monkeys. Despite its name, the monkeypox virus is no longer transmitted by monkeys. Scientists aren't sure, but it's thought to be spread by small rodents and squirrels in Africa's rainforests. Monkeypox virus is classified into two strains: Central African and West African. The Central African monkeypox virus causes more serious infections and is more likely to kill than the West African monkeypox virus."
