    step 0
    date "2022-05-26T14:00:13Z"
    title "Monkeypox Virus Symptoms And Treatment - Monkeypox Bimari Ka Ilaj - Monkeypox Virus In Pakistan"
    description "Monkeypox Virus Symptoms And Treatment - Monkeypox Bimari Ka Ilaj - Monkeypox Virus In Pakistan&#10;&#10;Today Dr. Tahira will discuss the topic of the monkeypox virus. Monkeypox belongs to the same virus family as smallpox but causes milder symptoms. It causes fever, limp nodes, body pain, and skin rashes. Rashes develop after 5 to 6 days of this virus. People with more serious illnesses may develop a rash and lesions on the face and hands that can spread to other parts of the body.&#10;&#10;Dr. Tahira Shahid is a Dermatologist practicing at Advanced International Hospital, Lahore. To book an appointment with Dr. Tahira, please visit the following link or call 042-3890-0939.&#10;&#10;https://oladoc.com/tahira-shahid/?utm_source=youtube&#38;utm_medium=referral&#38;utm_campaign=tahira_shahid&#38;utm_content=Monkeypox_causes_and_treatment&#10;&#10;Monkeypox can be caught from infected wild animals. It's thought to be spread by rodents, such as rats, mice, and squirrels. Body contact with an infected person can also spread this virus. And it can be cured in 2 to 3 weeks.&#10;&#10;Medications are available to treat this virus. Deal it like chickenpox and take proper medication. People with low immunity can be in danger from this virus. So, they have to be careful just like any other disease."
