    title "The Deadly Monkeypox Virus Outbreak 2022 #monkeypox #virus #zoonosis #shorts"
    description "Deadly Monkeypox Virus Outbreak 2022, Monkeypox Virus Outbreak 2022, Monkeypox Virus Outbreak, Deadly Virus Outbreak, Virus Outbreak 2022, Deadly Virus Outbreak 2022, Outbreak 2022, monkeypox outbreak 2022, Deadly Monkeypox Virus Outbreak, Monkeypox Virus Outbreak, Can you die from monkeypox, How do you get monkeypox, What causes monkeypox, Is monkeypox deadly, monkeypox outbreak, what is monkeypox virus, human monkeypox, monkeypox virus, zoonosis, what is monkeypox, monkeypox, shorts, youtubeshorts, Health Conscious&#10;&#10;The Deadly Monkeypox Virus Outbreak 2022 #monkeypox #virus #zoonosis&#10;Monkeypox virus is similar to the virus that causes smallpox (Variola virus). It is different from the Varicella-zoster virus (a herpes virus) which causes chickenpox. Monkeypox is a rare but potentially serious viral illness.&#10;&#10;#monkeypox #virus #zoonosis #health&#10;&#10;To get more updates, Share And Subscribe.&#128071;&#10;https://youtube.com/channel/UCA4ViUQlLXklwAkfN44UUiA?sub_confirmation=1&#10;&#10;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;Social Links&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#11015;&#65039;&#10;&#9989; Facebook:&#128073; https://www.facebook.com/HealthConscious77&#10;&#9989; Pinterest:&#128073; https://pin.it/5HWGXJx&#10;&#9989; Linkedin:&#128073; https://www.linkedin.com/groups/12634206/&#10;&#9989; Blogger:&#128073; https://www.blogger.com/blog/posts/4268733872061987645?hl=en&#38;tab=jj"
