    title "Monkeypox virus// Monkeypox outbreak// What is Monkeypox"
    description "Monkeypox is caused by the monkey pox virus. It is similar to smallpox. The monkeypox virus outbreak was first reported in England. Monkeypox is commonly found in West and Central Africa. Monkeypox has also been reported in the US. Signs and symptoms of monkeypox. Treatment and vaccination of monkey pox is similar to that of smallpox. Monkeypox is less contagious.&#10;Follow me on Instagram&#10;https://www.instagram.com/reel/CdI-b5oKPJV/?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=&#10;&#10;Watch my other videos&#10;&#10;breastfeeding&#10;https://youtu.be/mL_Bh4VHA_Y&#10;https://youtu.be/cMM422Cezrs&#10;nursing&#10;https://youtu.be/PoUHDdIy0-k&#10;https://youtu.be/sOs6vS4_2t8&#10;Hair&#10;https://youtu.be/YtQ57-8IzjQ&#10;https://youtu.be/ehPkVpeoBwg&#10;https://youtu.be/XK1y5IyQVQY&#10;God&#10;https://youtu.be/qB5pzFVeIYg&#10;Passion and happiness &#10;https://youtu.be/WpVRqRs1Ajw&#10;https://youtu.be/Dr5oeve3tN8&#10;college&#10;https://youtu.be/j4ENklWqbis&#10;#whatismonkeypox#Monkeypoxvirus#monkeypoxvirusoutbreak#monkeypoxtreatment#monkeypoxsigns#monkeypoxsymptoms#monkeypoxvaccination#newvirusoutbreak"
