    description "Monkeypox virus is a double-stranded DNA zoonotic virus that causes monkeypox in humans and other animals. It belongs to the genus Orthopoxvirus in the family Poxviridae. It is one of the human orthopoxviruses that includes variola, cowpox, and vaccinia viruses.&#10;&#10;#virus #monkeypoxoutbreak #newvirus #urdu #hindi #breakingnews #worldnama #pakistan #karachi #chickenpox #disease #hospital #monkey #europe #us #usa #uae #africa #virusspread #care #viral #news #2022 #world #who #health #meditation #newvacancies #vaccine #share #information #details #monkeypoxoutbreak"
