    id 490
    label "b4nBUFFX5xE"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-10T09:31:26Z"
    title "How Does A Person Gets Monkeypox?  | Monkeypox Virus #shorts #youtubeshorts #ytshorts #monkeypox"
    description "How Does A Person Gets Monkeypox? &#128018; | Monkeypox Virus #shorts #youtubeshorts #ytshorts #monkeypox&#10;&#10;&#10;In this YouTube short video you will get information about Monkeypox disease.&#10;&#10;Monkeypox is an infectious disease, which is caused by monkeypox virus.&#10;&#10;Monkeypox is a viral zoonosis. It spreads from animals to humans.&#10;&#10;Besides, monkeypox is a rare disease and it can be fatal in upto 10% of cases.&#10;&#10;Symptoms&#10;&#10;The symptoms of monkeypox are as follows&#10;&#10;*Fever &#129326;&#10;*Headache &#128514;&#10;*Muscle pain&#10;*Tiredness&#10;*Swollen lymph glands&#10;&#10;Besides, after few days, a rash appears that turns into blisters and crusts over.&#10;&#10;Transmission&#10;&#10;Monkeypox transmit through&#10;&#10;*Animal bite&#10;*Body fluids&#10;*Handling bushmeat&#10;*Contaminated objects&#10;*Close contact with infected persons&#10;&#10;Diagnosis&#10;&#10;To diagnose Monkeypox, your doctor may recommend you&#10;*Tissue samples&#10;*Blood test&#10;&#10;Treatment&#10;&#10;At present there is no effective treatment for monkeypox. &#10;&#10;Besides, to decrease the spread of the disease, you can take &#10;&#10;*Smallpox vaccine&#10;*Cidofovir&#10;*Vaccinia immune globulin (VIG)&#10;&#10;Prevention&#10;&#10;You can take the following preventable measures, which are as follows&#10;&#10;*Avoid contact with contaminated materials.&#10;*Wash your hands with soap and water.&#10;*Thoroughly cooked your non-vegetarian foods.&#10;*Avoid contact with infected person.&#10;*Always use PPE kit, when dealing with infected persons.&#10;&#10;---------------------------&#10;&#10;Your Queries&#10;&#10;Can Monkeypox be cured?&#10;Is monkeypox from Monkeys?&#10;What are the symptoms of monkeypox?&#10;&#10;---------------------&#10;&#10;#shortvideo&#10;#trending&#10;#viral&#10;#health&#10;#disease&#10;#vbhealthclubshorts&#10;#viralshorts&#10;#trendingshorts&#10;#monkeypoxvirus&#10;#monkeypoxdisease&#10;#monkeypoxvirusnews&#10;#monkeypoxinengland&#10;#monkeypoxoutbreak&#10;#monkeypoxcauses&#10;#monkeypoxsymptoms&#10;#monkeypoxtransmission&#10;#monkeypoxdiagnosis&#10;#monkeypoxtreatment&#10;#monkeypoxprevention&#10;#monkeypoxinenglish&#10;#monkeypoxyoutube&#10;#viralzoonosis&#10;&#10;----------------------&#10;&#10;Disclaimer&#10;&#10;Copyright Disclaimer under Section 107 of the copyright act 1976, allowance is made for fair use for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statute that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favour of fair use."
