  [
    id 491
    label "Z8zd2gT4ePI"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-24T20:16:10Z"
    title "What is Monkeypox Virus? Is there a cure for monkeypox? Explained in Detail"
    description "Monkeypox is usually a self-limited disease with the symptoms lasting from 2 to 4 weeks. Severe cases can occur. In recent times, the case fatality ratio has been around 3&#8211;6%.&#10;Monkeypox is transmitted to humans through close contact with an infected person or animal, or with material contaminated with the virus.&#10;Monkeypox virus is transmitted from one person to another by close contact with lesions, body fluids, respiratory droplets and contaminated materials such as bedding.&#10;Monkeypox is a viral zoonotic disease that occurs primarily in tropical rainforest areas of central and west Africa and is occasionally exported to other regions.&#10;An antiviral agent developed for the treatment of smallpox has also been licensed for the treatment of monkeypox.&#10;The clinical presentation of monkeypox resembles that of smallpox, a related orthopoxvirus infection which was declared eradicated worldwide in 1980. Monkeypox is less contagious than smallpox and causes less severe illness.&#10;Monkeypox typically presents clinically with fever, rash and swollen lymph nodes and may lead to a range of medical complications.&#10;Vaccines used during the smallpox eradication programme also provided protection against monkeypox. Newer vaccines have been developed of which one has been approved for prevention of monkeypox.&#10;&#10;Your Queries:&#10;Where is monkeypox in the US?&#10;How did the first person get monkeypox?&#10;What is the difference between chickenpox and monkeypox?&#10;What is the mortality rate of monkeypox?&#10;How do you get monkeypox virus?&#10;Is there a cure for monkeypox?&#10;Who spread monkey pox?&#10;Is monkeypox contagious?&#10;How many confirmed cases of monkeypox in the US?&#10;Is monkey pox airborne?&#10;Are smallpox vaccinations still given?&#10;Is monkeypox related to chickenpox?&#10;How to avoid monkeypox?&#10;Does monkeypox hurt?&#10;Is smallpox eradicated?&#10;Is chickenpox related to smallpox?&#10;What animal did chickenpox come from?&#10;Which animals cause monkeypox?&#10;monkeypox virus symptoms&#10;monkeypox virus structure&#10;monkeypox treatment&#10;monkeypox pictures&#10;monkeypox vs chickenpox&#10;monkeypox scientific name&#10;interesting facts about monkeypox&#10;monkeypox prevention&#10;monkeypox 2022&#10;monkeypox virus outbreak canada&#10;monkeypox virus australia&#10;monkeypox virus outbreak symptoms&#10;monkeypox virus outbreak australia&#10;how do you get monkeypox&#10;monkeypox dallas&#10;monkeypox nyc&#10;what is monkeypox 2022&#10;monkeypox new york&#10;monkeypox outbreak 2022&#10;monkeypox in canada&#10;monkeypox wiki&#10;stacey park milberneypox chicago&#10;monkeypox virus infection uk&#10;what is monkeypox uk&#10;whats monkeypox&#10;how do you catch monkeypox&#10;monkeypox montreal&#10;monkeypox uae&#10;can you die from monkeypox&#10;monkeypox spain&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Copyright Disclaimer:&#10;&#10; Under Section 107 of the Copyright Act 1976, allowance is made for 'fair use for purposes such as criticism, comment, news reporting, teaching, scholarship, and research. Fair use is a use permitted by copyright statutes that might otherwise be infringing. Non-profit, educational or personal use tips the balance in favor of fair use&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Photo Credit: Content Providers(s): CDC/James Hicks, Public domain, via Wikimedia Commons&#10;&#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#128126;&#128126; If you have any Issue with any video or any credit issue, Please let me know, I will immediately Correct/Delete the video. &#10;&#10;For any Query/Credit/Video issue, Please Mail me on : vineet_1710@yahoo.com&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;If you liked this video and found it interesting, Please Hit the Like button, share the video with your friends and family and Subscribe this Channel for more informative videos like this. &#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;Key Moments:&#10;0:00 Intro&#10;0:36 How monkeypox and smallpox are related to each other?&#10;1:23 What are The Pathogen for Monkeypox disease?&#10;2:02 What are Natural Host of monkeypox virus?&#10;2:30 Outbreaks into human population&#10;4:08 Modes of Transmission of Monkeypox Virus&#10;5:54 Signs and symptoms of Monkeypox&#10;8:11 What are the Complications of Monkeypox?&#10;8:29 How Monkeypox is Diagnosed ?&#10;What  is the Treatment of this disease ?&#10;Is there any Vaccine Available for Monkeypox ?&#10;How can we reduce the risk of human-to-human transmission?&#10;Quarantine period of Monkeypox&#10;-----------------------------------&#10;#MonkeypoxVirus #MonkeypoxDisease #Smallpox #SmallpoxVirus #Monkey #ScienceUnveiled"
